{"id": "tdf-2024-09-25-3d4f8f6e", "insurer_ids": ["tdf"], "date": "2024-09-25", "title_ja": "円で将来の年金原資をより大きくふやせるコースを追加！『ファイブテン・ワールド4』", "url": "https://www.tdf-life.co.jp/newsrelease/pdf/20240925.pdf", "source_owner": "tdf", "source_key": "release", "source_kind": "official", "retrieved_date": "2026-11-17", "snapshot": "sources/tdf/news/release_fy2024_2026-11-17.html", "title_en": "Adding a course that can grow future pension funds larger in yen! 'Five-Ten World 4'", "category": "product_launch", "importance": "high", "relevant": true, "product_ids": ["tdf-fiveten-world-4"], "enriched": {"by": "sonnet", "date": "2026-11-17"}, "summary_en": "T&D Financial Life Insurance (T&D Insurance Group) announced on 25 September 2024 that it will start selling \"Fiveten World 4\" on 1 October 2024. This is a renewal of its single-premium individual annuity \"Fiveten World 3\". The yen plan gains a new \"pension-focused course\", which has no care or dementia cover during the deferral period and so gets a higher accumulation rate and a larger pension fund. The existing care and dementia cover course stays. The foreign-currency plan, in US or Australian dollars, continues alongside. Deferral periods are 5 or 10 years for the yen plan."}
{"id": "tdf-2024-09-30-38d1b5d0", "insurer_ids": ["tdf"], "date": "2024-09-30", "title_ja": "26金融機関等にて『生涯プレミアムワールド6』の販売を開始", "url": "https://www.tdf-life.co.jp/newsrelease/pdf/202409301.pdf", "source_owner": "tdf", "source_key": "release", "source_kind": "official", "retrieved_date": "2026-11-17", "snapshot": "sources/tdf/news/release_fy2024_2026-11-17.html", "title_en": "Sales of '生涯プレミアムワールド6' (Lifetime Premium World 6) begin at 26 financial institutions, etc.", "category": "product_launch", "importance": "high", "relevant": true, "enriched": {"by": "sonnet", "date": "2026-11-17"}, "summary_en": "T&D Financial Life Insurance announced on 30 September 2024 that it will start selling \"Shogai Premium World 6\" through 26 financial institutions on 1 October 2024. The product is a non-participating whole life policy, with a yen version and a foreign-exchange-linked version. It merges the earlier Japan and World series. These 26 institutions include Aichi Bank, Aeon Bank, Shizuoka Bank and Mitsubishi UFJ Trust Bank. The company says 37 institutions in total will sell it as of 1 October. Four of the 26 (Kyoto Bank, Shizuoka Bank, Hiroshima Bank and Mitsubishi UFJ Trust Bank) will sell it witho"}
