{"id": "tdf-2026-04-10-c533229c", "insurer_ids": ["tdf"], "date": "2026-04-10", "title_ja": "保険代理店への出向者による不適切な情報持ち出しに関する調査結果について", "url": "https://www.tdf-life.co.jp/newsrelease/pdf/20260410.pdf", "source_owner": "tdf", "source_key": "release", "source_kind": "official", "retrieved_date": "2026-11-17", "snapshot": "sources/tdf/news/release_list_2026-11-17.html", "title_en": "Results of investigation into inappropriate removal of information by a person seconded to an insurance agency", "category": "regulatory_conduct", "importance": "high", "relevant": true, "enriched": {"by": "sonnet", "date": "2026-11-17"}, "summary_en": "On 10 April 2026, T&D Holdings, Taiyo Life, Daido Life and T&D Financial Life reported the results of their probe into improper information removal by staff seconded to agencies. Seconded staff took 141 items (other insurers' product information and agency sales results) from 9 agencies between April 2020 and August 2024: Daido Life accounted for 8 agencies and 72 items, T&D Financial Life for 2 agencies and 69 items, and Taiyo Life for none. The companies found no head-office instruction to take the information, no secondary use and no sharing with third parties. They have stopped all sales-r", "story_ids": ["life-insurer-secondee-information-case"]}
{"id": "tdf-2026-05-15-ce7c95cd", "insurer_ids": ["tdf"], "date": "2026-05-15", "title_ja": "役員人事および人事異動について", "url": "https://www.tdf-life.co.jp/newsrelease/pdf/202605152.pdf", "source_owner": "tdf", "source_key": "release", "source_kind": "official", "retrieved_date": "2026-11-17", "snapshot": "sources/tdf/news/release_list_2026-11-17.html", "title_en": "Executive appointments and personnel changes", "category": "corporate", "importance": "normal", "relevant": true, "enriched": {"by": "sonnet", "date": "2026-11-17"}}
{"id": "tdf-2026-06-04-cabbdb9a", "insurer_ids": ["tdf"], "date": "2026-06-04", "title_ja": "当社株式の譲渡に関するお知らせ", "url": "https://www.tdf-life.co.jp/newsrelease/pdf/20260604.pdf", "source_owner": "tdf", "source_key": "release", "source_kind": "official", "retrieved_date": "2026-11-17", "snapshot": "sources/tdf/news/release_list_2026-11-17.html", "title_en": "Notice regarding the transfer of the company's shares", "category": "corporate", "importance": "high", "relevant": true, "enriched": {"by": "sonnet", "date": "2026-11-17"}, "summary_en": "On 4 June 2026, T&D Financial Life Insurance said its parent, T&D Holdings, had signed share transfer agreements with PayPay and OneIM Indigo Holdings, an affiliate of One Investment Management. Under them, T&D Holdings will sell shares in the insurer. The sale is planned for 1 October 2027, subject to regulatory approval and IFRS preparations for consolidation into the PayPay group. The insurer will then leave T&D Holdings' consolidated subsidiaries. Its products, contract terms and its bank and agency-shop sales channels stay unchanged, and any change of company name will be announced later."}
